"P2664928753" "Okay, here's the deal.  The head of the Marcone family here in Port Oakes wants to talk you about doing a bit of work for them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to their office to meet up with him.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1415268299" "Talk with Emil Marcone"
// SendOffString :
"P1592427714" "Sounds good. This is your big chance to make good with the Family. And tell 'em Billie Heck sent ya!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P721418165" "Defeat all Verandi intruders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4102040926" "C'mon! Emil Marcone is waitin' on ya!  Ya don't let a guy like that wait!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3074535417" "You walk into the Family office only to be greeted by the sound of gunfire. It looks like the Marcone family is being attacked by the Verandi family!"

