// IntroString :
"P2358120512" "The Marcone family is really enraged by this attack by the Verandi family, and is looking for a bit of payback. Since you did a good job busting Verandi heads in that last battle, Emil Marcone wants you to help him get his revenge. You heard of Vanessa Verandi? She's the daughter of Guido 'The Mooch' Verandi, head of the Verandi family. She's coming in on a ship from the mainland right now. Emil wants you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>kidnap Venessa Verandi</A> to show the Verandi family that the Marcone family means business."
// AcceptString :
"P3872988162" "Kidnap Vanessa Verandi"
// SendOffString :
"P2588013154" "You do this one and you'll get in good with the Marcone family.<br><br>Emil Marcone sent one of his boys in ahead of time.  Meet up with Pitbull inside the ship and bust some Verandi heads. And get Vanessa!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1353428946" "What are you waiting for? Get Vanessa before the Verandi family gets wise to us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P348914457" "This Family smuggling ship smells musty.  The footsteps of guards echo through the voluminous holds."

