// IntroString :
"P3152749024" "You got Guido Verande, but now you gotta get Emil Marcone.  Marcone's a tough customer, but if you wanna get the Family off your back, you gotta sit him and Guido down and force a truce.  Emil often likes to hang out and one of the local casinos he runs called the Hook & Anchor. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over there and capture Emil Marcone!</A><br><br>Like Guido Verandi, Emil Marcone is a tough customer. Consider that a warning."
// AcceptString :
"P2589873242" "Capture Emil Marcone"
// SendOffString :
"P1582251529" "Capturing Emil should take the Marcone family off your back and force a truce."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2224218314" "What are talkin' to me for?  Emil Marcone is still out there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P912895883" "The patrons of the Hook & Anchor panic as your enter the building. They know something's up!"

