// IntroString :
"P3146991571" "Okay, it sounds like Guido Verande and Emil Marcone are willing to make a truce with you. But we got other problems - when Guido and Emil disappeared, a couple of their lieutenants took over! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The only way this is going to end is if you take down both Bloody Vicious and Pitbull.</A><br><br>They ain't no pushovers. You'd better bring some heavies with ya!"
// AcceptString :
"P259023911" "Take down Bloody Vicious and Pitbull"
// SendOffString :
"P277108098" "You do this and it'll show 'em that you can't be messed with!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1844925193" "Defeat Bloody Vicious, Pitbull, thugs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P725459642" "You waitin' for Bloody Vicious and Pitbull to come after you?  Get goin'!"

